          {
            "name_base": "Dounan Flower Market",
            "name_local": "斗南花卉市场",
            "location_base": "Jingui Street 76, Dounan Town, Chenggong District, Kunming City",
            "location_local": "云南省昆明市呈贡区斗南镇金桂街76号",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 24.878,
              "lng": 102.854
            },
            "cost": 0,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Market",
            "type_local": "鲜花交易市场",
            "notes_base": "Asia's largest fresh-cut flower trading market - over 2 billion stems traded annually. Arrive in the afternoon (13:00-17:00) when the main trading floor is still active and retail stalls are open. Rows upon rows of buckets filled with peonies, roses, lavender, orchids - incredible sensory experience and utterly photogenic. Buy a large bouquet for a few yuan - typical couple buy: 100 stems of seasonal flowers for under 50 CNY. RedNote tip: the main indoor trading hall (主场馆) is the best for photos. Take the Kunming Metro Line 1 to Dounan Station (斗南站). Verified via RedNote user reviews (3229 likes).",
            "notes_local": "亚洲最大鲜切花交易市场，年交易量超20亿枝。下午（13:00-17:00）到达，交易花圃仍在运营，零售摊位全部开放。各色鲜花排列成海，牡丹、玫瑰、薰衣草、兰花，颜值极高。买一把花只需几十元——情侣通常花50元不到就能抱走100支应季鲜花。小红书推荐：主场馆室内是拍照最美的地方。乘昆明地铁1号线到斗南站。",
            "opening_hours": "主场馆 06:00-20:00（零售区整日开放）",
            "optional": false,
            "search_results": [
