          {
            "name_base": "Cuihu (Green Lake) Park",
            "name_local": "翠湖公园",
            "location_base": "Cuihu South Road 67, Wuhua District, Kunming City",
            "location_local": "云南省昆明市五华区翠湖南路67号",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 25.058,
              "lng": 102.703
            },
            "cost": 0,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Scenic Area",
            "type_local": "湖泊公园",
            "notes_base": "A beautiful urban lake park in central Kunming - locals' favourite for afternoon walks. The park is ringed by old plane trees and willows with red pavilions over the water. Yunnan University (云南大学东陆校区) is right next door - a stunning historical campus with century-old architecture worth a quick wander (film location for Jiang Wen's 'The Sun Also Rises'). RedNote users describe the Cuihu + Yunnan University CityWalk as the most 文艺 route in Kunming. Combine the two for a 2-hour afternoon circuit. Entry is free. Arrive before 18:00 for best light. Verified via RedNote user reviews (1152 likes).",
            "notes_local": "昆明市中心的城市湖泊公园，是本地人最爱的散步地。湖边古树垂柳，红色亭台倒映水中，氛围静谧。紧邻云南大学东陆校区（百年老校，姜文电影《太阳照常升起》取景地），值得随手走进去逛逛。小红书用户一致认为翠湖+云大东陆校区CityWalk是昆明最文艺的路线。两处合并游览约2小时。全程免费。18:00前到达光线最好。",
            "opening_hours": "06:30-21:30",
            "optional": false,
            "search_results": [
              {
                "skill": "gaode-maps",
                "type": "poi_detail",
                "url": "https://amap.com/place/B0367065BF",
                "display_text": "翠湖公园 - 高德地图"
              },
              {
