          {
            "name_base": "Yunnan University Donglv (East) Campus",
            "name_local": "云南大学东陆校区",
            "location_base": "Cuihu North Road 2, Wuhua District, Kunming City",
            "location_local": "云南省昆明市五华区翠湖北路2号",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 25.065,
              "lng": 102.704
            },
            "cost": 0,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Historical Site",
            "type_local": "历史校园",
            "notes_base": "One of China's most beautiful university campuses - founded 1922. The Huize Building (会泽楼) is the iconic neoclassical centrepiece, with 99 stone steps leading up to it (symbolising the 99 graduates of the first class). Stroll the shaded campus paths among French parasol trees, historic dormitories, and small courtyards. Very few tourists - feels like a hidden garden. Cinematically beautiful in afternoon light. Combined with Cuihu Park (5 min walk) this forms the perfect half-day cultural wander. Public can enter freely during daylight hours. Verified via RedNote user reviews (1162 likes).",
            "notes_local": "中国最美校园之一，建于1922年。会泽楼是标志性建筑，前有99级石阶（象征首届99名毕业生）。校园内法国梧桐参天，历史宿舍和小院落散落其中。游客极少，犹如隐秘花园。下午光线下拍照极美。与翠湖公园（步行5分钟）组合，是完美的半天文艺漫步。白天免费对外开放。",
            "opening_hours": "校园全天开放（白天最佳）",
            "optional": true,
            "search_results": [
