        "attractions": [
          {
            "name_base": "Jade Dragon Snow Mountain Scenic Area",
            "name_local": "玉龙雪山国家级风景名胜区",
            "location_base": "Tourism Ring Road, Yulong Naxi Autonomous County, Lijiang City",
            "location_local": "云南省丽江市玉龙纳西族自治县旅游环线",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 27.098052,
              "lng": 100.258558
            },
            "cost": 105,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Natural Landmark",
            "type_local": "国家级自然风景区",
            "notes_base": "CRITICAL: Book tickets online in advance - cable car tickets sell out fast, especially in summer. Scenic area entrance: 105 CNY. Glacier Park cable car extra 160 CNY. Altitude 3,000-4,500m - bring warm layers even in June, bring altitude sickness medication. Depart by 07:00 to catch the 08:00 opening. Take the 101 special bus from Zhongyi Market (忠义市场). Recommended: Glacier Park (4680m viewpoint) OR Yunshu Ping (云杉坪) meadow - choose one. In June, snowpack may be thin at Glacier Park - check recent conditions on RedNote before going. Verified via RedNote user reviews.",
            "notes_local": "重要：提前网上购票，缆车票夏季极易售罄。景区门票105元，冰川公园索道另付160元。海拔3000-4500米，6月仍需带厚外套，准备高反药。早上07:00前出发，从忠义市场乘101路专线。推荐选择冰川公园（4680网红打卡）或云杉坪草甸之一，不要贪多。6月冰川雪量可能偏少，出发前在小红书查看近况。",
            "opening_hours": "06:00-16:30",
            "optional": false,
            "search_results": [
              {
                "skill": "gaode-maps",
                "type": "poi_detail",
                "url": "https://amap.com/place/B0378008FA",
                "display_text": "玉龙雪山 - 高德地图"
              },
              {
                "skill": "rednote",
