        "location": "Lijiang",
        "attractions": [
          {
            "name_base": "Shuhe Old Town",
            "name_local": "束河古镇",
            "location_base": "Shuhe Town, Lijiang City, Yunnan Province",
            "location_local": "云南省丽江市束河镇",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 26.9196,
              "lng": 100.205679
            },
            "cost": 0,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Historical Site",
            "type_local": "历史古镇",
            "notes_base": "REST DAY - take it slow. Much quieter and less touristy than Lijiang Old Town. Known for artsy cafes with beautiful courtyard gardens. Recommended: Shanzhu Coffee (山竹咖啡) with bamboo forest courtyard and lounge sofas (Bohemian + new Chinese style, very photogenic), and Dao Yu Coffee (岛与咖啡) with large green lawn for afternoon sun-bathing. Stroll along the ancient canals and Shuhe Square. Half-day leisurely wander is perfect. Verified via RedNote user reviews.",
            "notes_local": "休息日，慢慢逛。比丽江古城安静，文艺咖啡馆遍布。推荐山竹咖啡（波西米亚竹林院子，多处躺椅沙发座，超出片）和岛与咖啡（大草坪，午后晒太阳极好）。沿古镇水渠漫步，在四方听音广场坐坐。半天慢悠悠逛就好。",
            "opening_hours": "24小时开放",
            "optional": false,
            "search_results": [
              {
