      {
        "day": 6,
        "date": "2026-06-25",
        "location": "Dali",
        "attractions": [
          {
            "name_base": "Dali Old Town (Evening Arrival)",
            "name_local": "大理古城",
            "location_base": "Huguo Road 172, Dali City, Yunnan Province",
            "location_local": "云南省大理白族自治州大理市护国路172号",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 25.694836,
              "lng": 100.164
            },
            "cost": 0,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Historical Site",
            "type_local": "历史古城",
            "notes_base": "After the 3-hour self-drive from Lijiang, do a gentle evening stroll of Dali Old Town. The city is dramatically set between Cangshan Mountain (苍山) and Erhai Lake (洱海). Explore Renmin Road (人民路) - the main street with artsy cafes and bookshops. The old town has a distinct Bai minority architecture style: white walls, grey tiles, painted eaves. Much more relaxed than Lijiang. Evening atmosphere is peaceful and romantic. Verified via RedNote user reviews.",
            "notes_local": "从丽江自驾约3小时抵达后，傍晚轻松游览大理古城。古城位于苍山和洱海之间，风光独特。逛人民路，有许多文艺咖啡馆和书店。大理古城的白族建筑（白墙灰瓦、彩绘飞檐）与丽江风格截然不同。氛围比丽江更放松、更浪漫。",
            "opening_hours": "24小时开放",
            "optional": false,
            "search_results": [
