            "type_base": "Historical Site",
            "type_local": "古镇景区",
            "notes_base": "Located on the east shore of Erhai Lake - offers the best sunset views looking west across the lake to Cangshan Mountain. Boutique guesthouses perched right over the water create an incredibly romantic lakeside atmosphere. The pebble beaches here are great for sitting and watching the sunset over the mountains. Note: east shore is ~30km drive from west shore, so plan accordingly - take a taxi after the morning west shore cycling. Many artsy cafes and boutique hotels with lake-view terraces. Verified via RedNote user reviews.",
            "notes_local": "位于洱海东岸，是观看苍山日落倒影的最佳视角。精品民宿直接建在水边，洱海就在窗外，氛围极为浪漫。湖边鹅卵石滩适合坐着看日落。注意：东西岸距离约30公里，建议上午骑完西岸廊道后打车过来。文艺咖啡馆和观景台众多，是拍照出片的好地方。",
            "opening_hours": "24小时开放",
