            "name_local": "海舌生态公园",
            "location_base": "Haishe Peninsula, Erhai Lake West Shore, Dali City",
            "location_local": "云南省大理市洱海西岸海舌半岛",
            "coordinates": {
              "lat": 25.787,
              "lng": 100.174
            },
            "cost": 0,
            "currency_local": "CNY",
            "type_base": "Natural Landmark",
            "type_local": "湿地生态公园",
            "notes_base": "Optional afternoon visit after Xizhou. A scenic wetland peninsula that juts into Erhai Lake - three sides surrounded by water, with panoramic views of Cangshan Mountain across the lake. Very few tourists. RedNote recommendation: advance online booking required. Allow 1 hour. Wild birds, calm water, secluded atmosphere - ideal INFJ escape spot. Located on the way back from Xizhou to Dali. Verified via RedNote user reviews.",
            "notes_local": "喜洲游览后可顺路来的下午选项。海舌半岛三面环水，伸入洱海，游客极少，苍山倒影完美。小红书推荐需提前网上预约。游览1小时足够。鸟类众多，湖面宁静，是INFJ逃离人群的绝佳之地。从喜洲回大理途中可顺路停留。",
            "opening_hours": "需提前预约",
