            "type_base": "Historical Site",
            "type_local": "历史古城",
            "notes_base": "Quick morning wander before flying back to Beijing. The old town is peaceful in the morning. Grab a final local breakfast - try Dali rice noodles (洱丝, Erhai noodles) or milk fan (乳扇). Buy any last-minute souvenirs. Ensure you leave for the airport (Dali Fengyi Airport, 大理凤仪机场) with plenty of buffer - allow 1.5 hours before departure, the airport is about 15km from the old town.",
            "notes_local": "飞回北京前的清晨最后一逛。古城早上安静，吃个最后的大理早餐——推荐洱丝（米线）或乳扇。顺手买最后的伴手礼。注意留足前往大理凤仪机场的时间，机场距古城约15公里，建议提前1.5小时出发。",
